{"repositoryId":1177882002,"availability":"available","full":"garvjain7/codeAlive","name":"codeAlive","description":"Collaborating on code in real-time is a core challenge in many developer workflows. Existing tools are powerful but often overkill for quick sharing or team demos. I wanted something fast, simple, and accessible — a tool where you can write code, share it instantly, and let others contribute in real-time, all through a short URL","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-10T13:21:17Z","updated":"2026-08-17T15:48:41Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://codealive.onrender.com/","topics":["backend","caching","codemirror6","css","fastapi","front-end-development","frontend","html","postgresql","python","python3","redis","render-deployment","vanilla-js"],"demo":"https://codealive.onrender.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-20T05:25:13.990Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-20T05:25:13.990Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-20T05:25:13.990Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T23:50:06.346Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-20T05:25:13.990Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Paste code. Share files. No friction, no login required.","CodeAlive is a developer tool for sharing code snippets and files instantly — with syntax highlighting, live file previews, password protection, and shareable links that just work."],"features":["Zero-friction sharing — paste, hit share, get a permanent link. No account required.","Custom or random URLs — pick your own slug (e.g. /my-bug) or get a generated short one.","30+ language auto-detection — detects language as you type with 1s debounce, instant on paste.","Syntax highlighting — powered by CodeMirror 6 with a custom dark theme.","Line highlighting — mark specific lines; the highlight travels with the link."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/garvjain7/codeAlive/blob/main/README.md","f